Package: duop
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kostiantyn Nedbailo <ChessPlayerSedoy@gmail.com>
Description: Dual-pane TUI file manager in pure x86-64 GNU Assembler
 Zero-libc static ELF64 dual-pane terminal file manager with TrueColor UI,
 background copy/move/delete, io_uring batch stat, archive VFS, git status,
 syntax highlighting, ELF64 inspector, hex editor, and embedded PTY terminal.
